OL,3,GNEWSABeing scammed is 'such a challenge
OL,4,Ato overcome'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man who was scammed two years ago
OL,7,Fsaid it was still impacting his
OL,8,Fday-to-day life and was "such a
OL,9,Fchallenge to overcome".
OL,11,FNew figures published by the States of
OL,12,FJersey Police show more than #5.7m has
OL,13,Fbeen lost to fraud in Jersey in 2026.
OL,15,FJersey farmer Ollie Griggs said he was
OL,16,Fscammed two years ago when someone
OL,17,Fphoned him pretending to be from a bank
OL,18,Fand although he got his money back, he
OL,19,Fwas still "skeptical" when he received
OL,20,Fa call from an unknown number.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
