OL,3,GNEWSABeing scammed is 'such a challenge
OL,4,Ato overcome'
OL,5,
OL,6,FMatt Palmer, from Jersey and Guernsey
OL,7,FSecurity Centre, said the police's
OL,8,Flatest figure was "probably higher"
OL,9,Fbecause not everyone who was scammed
OL,10,Freported it.
